&_nc_oc=AdpzfLnrxPBrJ4vu0yqWcrCSJLnw_ziExxzx-uAvD6FGqdtlvGc0Fve2AvYUJfldCGA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5PtuuEhGVrVPQCcZjdWblHL8QU7-vf9WrH3Zy-r0BjOQ&oe=6A1EF3BE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GLzA0xfCuqgQ7kNvwHAPGiN&_nc_oc=Adp5V90ERsYZ2SC4S7SU3Tw3l3A1DDy7QCmRBrzRz1-yHJOkZUzyUtn7juiMNMaqBXg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af61FtpKEaLxwSl-FNoBKoKfyRxQ8rdkl5kkLHanb1qbWA&oe=6A1ECC7C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iBzcp691aoAQ7kNvwENHbt-&_nc_oc=AdrI_BjoLNAxsmjXMRcpW-TfZtNXB38UbP_ehGpoubyfYV7kpJhDKycMl0mIakk4OUk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6LslWYGLDhipnkgWFoqkb0BjyCcED09RFqixao-A9xtA&oe=6A1EEB07"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ph18tUpd9o8Q7kNvwGT7m5W&_nc_oc=AdqRDhSM_0LA1IuhLUxNwOtDfZqbfkjCaRAiRgHh0LswL6_1wi31HrnqxrqyR1eBCC8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7Z5xusS8zA0fn0Qp5t5eEcxaKev7H8iYxVTxqwlDfqpw&oe=6A1ED6D5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X1eWGP-I19sQ7kNvwHSPBvg&_nc_oc=AdqsnQ-8hIPZAPH1cT2lZTOMUXBiSXf83TRNRqwpJs3VOnuF7ZoR4_LiK1X91iVnRhc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af51fDh3EGTTT4vjcFdcXcN2640TGTp65rePVlPjp6vUbA&oe=6A1EE364"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.